WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.505
My name is Ali and I have been living in Cologne for a month. My flat is not big, but it is bright and cosy. It is on the third floor. Unfortunately there is no lift.

00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:25.460
The flat has two rooms, a kitchen and a bathroom. In the living room there is a sofa, a table and a big shelf of books. In the bedroom I have a bed and a wardrobe.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:32.826
My favourite spot is the balcony. That is where I drink my coffee in the morning. From there I can see the cathedral.

00:00:33.076 --> 00:00:44.233
The rent is 650 euros a month. That is not cheap, but the flat is close to the station and I only need ten minutes to get to work.
